  "theorem_shape": "For n=3f+1 and q=2f+1, if the unique honest quorum-intersection pivot must receive enabling evidence E and a later repair/terminal message R shares the same directed edge, then a type-uniform view graph cannot both form the first quorum and keep the pivot available for a conflicting quorum. A phase-specific schedule can deliver E while omitting R; bounded late delivery can defer R past round two."
